.el .ds Aq '
.TH hipfire-chat 1  "hipfire-chat " 
.SH NAME
hipfire\-chat \- Load a model and generate a response (one\-shot)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBhipfire\-chat\fR [\fB\-m\fR|\fB\-\-model\fR] [\fB\-\-max\-tokens\fR] [\fB\-\-temperature\fR] [\fB\-\-attach\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIPROMPT\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Load a model and generate a response (one\-shot)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-m\fR, \fB\-\-model\fR \fI<MODEL>\fR
Model name, alias, or path. Falls back to the `default_model` config value when omitted
.TP
\fB\-\-max\-tokens\fR \fI<MAX_TOKENS>\fR
Max tokens to generate
.TP
\fB\-\-temperature\fR \fI<TEMPERATURE>\fR
Sampling temperature
.TP
\fB\-\-attach\fR \fI<FILE>\fR
Attach a file to the prompt (repeatable). The type is detected from the extension. Only images are wired today (PNG/JPEG/WebP/GIF/BMP); text, video, and audio are recognized but not yet supported and will error
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIPROMPT\fR>
Prompt text
